		(property "Description" "WCAP-CSGP Ceramic Capacitors\n\nCharacteristics\n\nMultilayer Ceramic Chip Capacitor\nRecommended soldering:Reflow, for 0603 and 0805 wave soldering is also allowed\nOperating temperature:-55 °C to +125 °C;\nCeramic characteristics: Class I - NPO ; Class II -X7R, X5R\nHigh performance ceramic\nHigh capacitance stability\nMinimal aging\nTermination:Cu/Ni/Sn\n\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/eisos/WCAP-CSGP_pf2.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WCAP-CSGP-0805? http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WCAP-CSGP-0805?\n\nCreated:  2015-01-28\n2015 (C) Wurth Elektronik"
