		(property "Description" "WE-CBF SMD EMI Suppression Ferrite Bead\n\nCharacteristics\n\nReliable Ni-Sn electrodes\n\nHigh rated current up to 6 A\n\nOperating temperature: –55 ºC to +125 ºC\n\nApplications\n\nPerfect as data lined filter and for uncoupling of distribution voltage\n\nVariant abbreviation\nWB means WIDE BAND\nHS means HIGH SPEED\nHC means HIGH CURRENT\n\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/v2/Family_WE-CBF.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-CBF http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-CBF\n\nUpdated on 2014-06-19\n2014 (C) Wurth Elektronik"
